KNOWN GAPS
  Skill help is the biggest documentation hole: 119 of 158 skills have
  no topic under doc/help/user. Roughly 25 OCC help topics are also
  missing.
  Legacy heal skills (_mheal, _mend, _heal, _rot) still call
  heal_limb() and are harmless no-ops under the pooled damage model.
  They need a cleanup pass with their class gating.
  Player housing and storage is designed but parked.
  Vehicle interiors are thin.

CONVENTIONS FOR CONTENT
  Read docs/STYLE.md before writing player-facing strings.
  Check /domains/Praxis/adm/master_gap_report.txt for the current gap
  analysis before starting new content.
  Directory naming under domains/ is documented in CLAUDE.md rule 19.
  Renames need explicit approval; flag inconsistencies instead of
  fixing them silently.
